{"id":802486,"title":"结束语｜我怎么看KG-RAG的现在和未来？","content":"构建高质量的灵活更新系统虽然计算简单但成本高昂，性价比低，不适合实际部署。将文档转化为图谱涉及实体识别、链接及关键抽取等步骤，误差较大。使用Tex2SQL生成查询语句在单跳查询中尚可，但多跳查询难度极大，建议参与CCKS比赛以了解其复杂性。利用已有知识图谱(KG)作为召回路径简单且不增加检索压力，但需考虑KG排名算法。为KG建立索引会增加存储与检索消耗，频繁更新更添负担，微软Graph RAG虽理念先进但落地困难。社区应培养成员独立思考和搜索能力，而非单纯资料分享平台，强调动手实践的重要性。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":398832,"user_name":"37.2","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2219666,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"3B20A30414BD6E","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/21/de/92/659322ad.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1742400230,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100799801,"comment_content":"1. 老师觉得未来RAG的发展方向是什么？\n2. RAG是否在未来会在大模型应用实现方案中无用武之地，在大模型能力增强的情况下，或者token更大\n3. 我的认知是，RAG会伴随着大模型应用存在，大模型需要一个为其提供个性化数据的系统","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":393874,"user_name":"枫树","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1267891,"ip_address":"四川","ucode":"84B81DAD9C832E","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/58/b3/abb3256b.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1725232221,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100799801,"comment_content":"视频中提到的技术交流群，请问如何加入","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1483317,"avatar":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJNAiaXKMKRVRvE0QwSS2icHmhKLCkhLHnwYxnBPR0WdOm6JNJFb0QolzC91YrZD6aib3o0zVXa2ibjdQ/132","nickname":"Geek_63fe1e","note":"","ucode":"1D9928377534F0","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":651212,"discussion_content":"去他公众号，好像是付费会员","content_length":13,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1726546025,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"浙江","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extr